      "content": "Subject: Power Up Your Day: Simple Ergonomic Tips to Protect Your Focus\n\nTo help you conquer your workday without distraction, let's talk about ergonomics, because those small, nagging aches can stealthily chip away at your focus. When posture breaks down, those minor neck or wrist twinges can start sabotaging your concentration, turning a productive flow into a source of frustration. Start small: make sure your monitor is eye-level, keep those wrists neutral while typing, and consciously remind yourself to move every hour. By investing this little time in your setup, you protect your energy for the bigger wins!",
